      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "十二种可玩光标各自拥有不同战斗风格",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Battle your way through swarms of malicious viruses using the many different playable cursors, each with their own unique playstyle.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3054210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "收集三十种以上EXE与百种随机掉落对抗病毒",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "100+ randomized loot drops to be discovered 30+ EXEs to suit every play-style",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3054210/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
